Hallmark's skill architecture — a natural-language instruction kernel with
progressively-loaded references, verb dispatch, a pre-emit critique, and a
gate-based quality check — and replaces its subject matter entirely: design
judgment becomes software-engineering judgment. The copyright notice above is
retained in accordance with the MIT License.

